Calling upon nature, you cause the ground to erupt in an radius [2, 2, 2, 2, 3 (TL1-5)] acidic explosion, dealing [134, 180, 216, 246, 273 (TL1-5; MP 100)] acid damage to all creatures and creating mucus in the area.

Any Mucus Oozes you have active will, if in line of sight, instantly spit slime (at reduced power) at one of the targets hit by the splash.

The damage increases with your Mindpower.
